  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical assistance to establish and implement an impact measurement and management framework</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WaterQuip is a social enterprise providing water purification systems for rural and urban schools in Uganda. Established in 2020, they provide robust, chemical-free water filter solutions for schools to filter their water at point of use. They are currently serving over 600 schools with an estimated 300,000 children receiving safe water daily. This TA project would address the need to establish and implement an impact measurement and management framework.Setting up an impact monitoring frameworkSetting up a digital impact monitoring and management systemInstallation of smart meters for schools</narrative>
  </description>
